<title>UK: IADB sets 150 million rand five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>IADB sets 150 million rand five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.625    MATURITY    19.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   1.375</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
